<div className={styles.pvlRoot}>
	{{block('/-/block/hero_full.html?variant=7-f4d19fa1eb-1dw2bm&version=2')}}
	<div class="row bg-light p-6 rounded-5 mb-18">
		<div class="column p-6 rounded-5 bg-light mb-18">
			<div class="pvlRichtext" style="text-align:center"><h1 style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size: 24px;">You can make a difference in Greenville. Adopt an Angel today!</span></strong></h1>
<p style="text-align: center;">The Salvation Army of Greenville Angel Tree program, in collaboration with Toys for Tots, helps provide Christmas gifts for thousands of children in our community each year. Once a child has been registered and accepted as an Angel, their Christmas wish list is shared with donors in our area who purchase gifts of new clothing and toys. The gifts are distributed to the family to place under their family Christmas tree.</p></div>
			<div class="my-5"></div>
			<div class="pvlRichtext" style="font-size:18px"><h2><strong><span style="color: red; font-size: 18px;">SHOP FOR ANGEL TREE GIFTS</span></strong></h2>
<p>If you'd like to contribute to the Angel Tree program, you can easily and quickly shop one of our online gift registries. The items you purchase for children in need in Greenville will ship directly to our Christmas Distribution Center. We will organize the gifts and share them with families who are unable to provide gifts for their children this year. You can also make a financial contribution, and we can use those funds to help provide clothes and toys to children on our Angel Tree list.&nbsp;</p></div>
			<div class="row my-3">
				<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
					<div class="pvlRichtext" style="font-size:18px"><p><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;">Target Angel Tree Registry</span></strong></p>
<p class="card-text">Shop online at Target and select gifts to be delivered directly to The Salvation Army of Greenville, SC's Angel Tree program. All gifts will be distributed to children in need in our community.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://www.target.com/gift-registry/gift-giver?registryId=cc019130-5ef4-11ee-9194-977fd23a0d5b&amp;type=CHARITY">Shop</a></p></div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
					<div class="pvlRichtext" style="font-size:18px"><p><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;">Amazon Angel Tree Registry</span></strong></p>
<p class="card-text">Shop and donate gifts directly from Amazon through our Angel Tree registry. Gifts will be shipped to The Salvation Army of Greenville and delivered to children in need before Christmas.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://www.amazon.com/registries/gl/guest-view/3P2HI1XD93HB5">Shop</a></p></div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
					<div class="pvlRichtext" style="font-size:18px"><p><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;">Donate Financially</span></strong></p>
<p class="card-text">Financial donations are a great way to help during the busy holiday season. All donations go directly to helping individuals and families in your local community.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://give.salvationarmycarolinas.org/campaign/698428/donate">Shop</a></p></div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="my-5"></div>
			<div class="pvlRichtext" style="text-align:center"><p style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: red; font-size: 18px;">APPLY FOR ANGEL TREE ASSISTANCE</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">If you need help and would like to participate in our annual Angel Tree program, please complete our form. Applications will close on October 15, 2026, or earlier if we reach capacity. If you are approved as one of our Angel Tree families, we will follow up with you soon.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://www.cognitoforms.com/TheSalvationArmy46/_2026AngelTreeEligibilityApplication">Register For Angel Tree</a></p></div>
			<div class="my-5"></div>
			<div class="my-5"></div>
			<div class="my-5"></div>
			<div class="pvlRichtext" style="color:red;text-align:center"><p style="color: red; font-size: 18px; text-align: center;"><strong>2026 LOGO COMPETITION</strong></p>
<p style="color: black; text-align: center;">Your design could be the official 2026 Angel Tree logo! See the official guidelines below.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://8hxvw8tw.media.zestyio.com/Angel-Tree-2026-Logo-Competition-Entry.pdf">Logo Competition Details</a></p>
